# GitHub auth (FrontendCraft)

This repository belongs to **samirasaad/FrontendCraft**. Never use the `samiras3d` account for git or `gh` operations here.

Before any `git push`, `gh pr create`, or other remote GitHub command:

1. Run `gh auth switch -u samirasaad -h github.com` (or `scripts/ensure-github-auth.sh`)
2. Do not ask the user which account to use — always `samirasaad`

The `.githooks/pre-push` hook switches accounts automatically on push.
